What:           /sys/bus/platform/devices/.../cycle_count_info
Date:           September 2026
Contact:        johnmart19 <johnivan19999@gmail.com>
Description:
                Read-only FG4 cycle-count diagnostics. source is fuel-gauge
                for the explicitly configured unidentified replacement
                fallback, or ds28e16 for identified packs when enabled.
                reported is the exported cycle count, or -1 when unavailable;
                report_error is the corresponding errno. fg_initialized and
                fg_last_error describe restoration/storage validity.
                fg_cycles is the average of the eight raw fg_buckets, or -1
                before successful restoration. Buckets are 16-bit counters.

                The fuel-gauge history belongs to this device's persistent
                storage and is not automatically tied to a replacement cell.
                A high value is not reset merely because a pack is unknown.
                Profile reload does not reset cycles. Existing physical
                battery-removal handling is unchanged. This interface cannot
                infer missing cycle history or the age of reused electronics.
